<section class="page-shell clinical-shell"><div class="page-header"><span class="eyebrow">Human-in-the-loop safeguarding</span><h1>Care Review Queue</h1><p>No flagged event is designed to be handled by an algorithm alone. Review, document and route each item.</p></div>
  <div class="review-grid"><section><h2>Safeguarding flags <span class="count-badge"><%= flags.length %></span></h2><div class="list-stack"><% flags.forEach(f=>{ %><article class="card review-card risk-border-<%= f.riskLevel %>"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="tag"><%= f.source %></span><h3><%= f.User?.name || 'User' %></h3><small><%= f.User?.email %></small></div><span class="status risk-<%= f.riskLevel %>"><%= f.riskLevel %></span></div><blockquote><%= f.excerpt %></blockquote><form method="post" action="/reviewer/flags/<%= f.id %>" class="form-stack"><div class="form-grid two"><label>Status<select name="status"><option value="acknowledged">Acknowledged</option><option value="escalated">Escalated</option><option value="closed">Closed</option></select></label><label>Action taken<input name="actionTaken" placeholder="Human contact / warm handover / reviewed"></label></div><label>Reviewer notes<textarea name="reviewerNotes" rows="3"></textarea></label><button class="button button-sm">Save human review</button></form></article><% }) %><% if(!flags.length){ %><div class="card empty-state"><h3>No active risk flags.</h3></div><% } %></div></section>
  <section><h2>Community moderation <span class="count-badge"><%= lanterns.length %></span></h2><div class="list-stack"><% lanterns.forEach(l=>{ %><article class="card review-card"><div class="section-heading"><span class="tag"><%= l.theme %></span><small><%= l.pod %></small></div><blockquote><%= l.content %></blockquote><% if(l.safetyFlag){ %><p class="warning-text">Safeguarding language detected — review linked care risk before publishing.</p><% } %><form method="post" action="/reviewer/lanterns/<%= l.id %>" class="button-row"><button name="action" value="approve" class="button button-sm">Approve</button><button name="action" value="reject" class="button button-ghost button-sm">Reject</button></form></article><% }) %></div></section></div>
</section>
